      "content": "Thanks. I want to dig a bit deeper into that second part. When you look at the critiques regarding the cost and the impact on fossil fuel jobs, do you see those as being rooted in substantive, evidence-based economic analysis, or do they strike you as more of a political talking point used to stall the transition? Also, how does that compare to the supporters' claims about the long-term necessity of the bill?",
